{
  "slug": "nuclear-energy",
  "title": "Nuclear Energy - Cross Party Group",
  "purpose": "The purpose of the Cross-Party Group on Nuclear Energy is to provide a forum for discussion on the future of the civil nuclear sector in Wales. The Group will consider the opportunities and challenges associated with the new nuclear development, the proposed Gwyndod project on Ynys Môn, and its potential contribution to clean energy, economic growth, jobs and investment. The CPG will provide a forum to discuss both the opportunities and challenges ahead and support the Welsh Government in delivering its devolved responsibilities for the sector. Working closely with local partners and representatives, this group will play an important role in supporting both the sector and the Welsh Government as progress continues on the Gwyndod development.",
